%% Title: Collection cycle · part 2 of 3 · fetch, normalise, store, score
%% Summary: What one open route of a claimed source does: the guarded HTTP fetch, normalisation with redaction, the admission filter and the provenance fingerprint, storage with the ingest and admission versions, scoring (ingest queue for scheduled and refresh runs, inline for npm run collect and standup) with audit rows, and the run record.
%% Sources: src/collectors/{index,base,http,netguard,transport,robots,normalize,identity,provenance,errors,redact,state,refusal,cycle,runner,ai-filter}.js, src/workers/{collect,ingest}.worker.js, src/pipeline/{ingest,sentiment,relevance,discourse,methodology}.js, src/config/methodology-registry.js; migrations 022, 031, 040, 042, 062. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md section 8 (PII handling, provenance); ADR 0001 (terms and politeness, D2); PR #22 decision G6.
flowchart LR

  subgraph FETCH["Fetch · one collector per open route"]
    direction TB
    F1["13 · buildCollectors(): one instance per open route;<br/>the constructor throws GateClosedError<br/>if route.requires is missing"]:::done
    F2["14 · HttpClient checks every hop before sending it:<br/>https only, public host, route allowedHosts (SSRF guard),<br/>DNS answers checked and pinned;<br/>robots.txt for RSS / Atom feeds (not arXiv or<br/>licensed feeds), Pew's WordPress API and<br/>Discourse forums (conservative);<br/>redirects followed manually, max 4;<br/>a credentialed request never crosses origins"]:::done
    F3["15 · User-Agent PulseOfAI/#lt;version#gt; (+contact URL);<br/>per-host spacing; 20 s timeout;<br/>at most 2 retries on 429 / 5xx (honouring Retry-After)<br/>and network errors (not DNS failures);<br/>ETag / Last-Modified → 304 not modified"]:::done
    F4["16 · caps: 5 MB decoded per response (route override),<br/>robots.txt 500 KiB, bulk file 50 MB;<br/>a DTD with entity declarations is refused"]:::done
    F5{"401 / 403 / 451, bot<br/>challenge or robots<br/>disallow?"}:::done
    F1 --> F2 --> F3 --> F4 --> F5
  end

  subgraph NORM["Normalise · base.js collect() → toPayload()"]
    direction TB
    N1["17 · raw text capped, HTML to text (linear),<br/>identity redaction, ingest@1.7.0: e-mails, @handles,<br/>Reddit u/ names, phones, profile links, cc names,<br/>sign-offs, Wikipedia unsigned notes"]:::done
    N2["18 · allowlisted payload: title, text, link unless an<br/>identity link, published_at, language, city-level<br/>location (basis content or publisher), licence,<br/>attribution; an identity-bearing upstream id is<br/>stored only as route:fp:HMAC (an unkeyed<br/>SHA-256 when no key is set)"]:::done
    N3["19 · provenance_fingerprint = HMAC-SHA256(<br/>PROVENANCE_KEY or AUDIT_HASH_KEY,<br/>slug : upstream id : source URL)"]:::done
    N4["20 · drop items older than maxAgeDays (default 7);<br/>admission filter admission_filter@1.0.0<br/>(AI scope, ai-filter.js) on scope 'filter' routes;<br/>dedupe within the batch"]:::done
    N1 --> N2 --> N3 --> N4
  end

  subgraph STORE["Store and score · pipeline/ingest.js"]
    direction TB
    T1["21 · storeRawPost(): strip NUL, drop PII_FIELDS,<br/>SHA-256 content hash, dedupe on<br/>(source_id, external_id), insert raw_posts (text only<br/>in content) with provenance_fingerprint, ingest_mv_id<br/>and admission_mv_id, plus one data_retention_log<br/>row 'collected' in the same statement"]:::done
    T2{"new post?"}:::done
    T3["22 · the run's job: a scheduled run joins the cycle job<br/>(cycle.currentCycleJob(), advisory lock; the running<br/>cron job of this window or a new one; inflight_runs + 1);<br/>a refresh uses its pre-created job; npm run collect<br/>and standup create theirs at the first new post"]:::done
    T7{"scoreVia?"}:::done
    T4["23 · queue (scheduled and refresh runs):<br/>reserveRetry (inflight_runs + 1), then one<br/>ingest job per new post (id score-#lt;post#gt;);<br/>ingest.worker scores it under its own job,<br/>releases the slot, applies the embed gate"]:::done
    T8["23 · inline (npm run collect, standup):<br/>scorePost(): sentiment, relevance, discourse;<br/>each writes its *_results row and one<br/>decision_audit_log row (current methodology)"]:::done
    T5["inline scoring failed → reserveRetry + ingest<br/>retry job; an enqueue failed (either mode) →<br/>slot released, run error, the 24 h<br/>unscored sweep re-queues the post"]:::done
    T6["store failed → restore the route's cursor<br/>and HTTP validators, run error"]:::done
    T1 --> T2
    T2 -- yes --> T3 --> T7
    T7 -- queue --> T4
    T7 -- inline --> T8
  end

  subgraph RECORD["Record the run · state.js, runner.js"]
    direction TB
    V1["24 · classify errors: error_kind + http_status only;<br/>error text scrubbed of every secret (redact.js)"]:::done
    V2["25 · saveOutcome() on source_collection_state:<br/>cursor, HTTP validators, last success / error,<br/>last_new_post_at, consecutive_failures"]:::done
    V3["26 · refused → recordRefusal(): refused_until,<br/>refusal_count + 1, one critical source_refused<br/>alert; a successful probe ends the refused state<br/>and starts a 24 h probation (a refusal on probation<br/>escalates the cooldown, up to 24 h; 24 h clean decays the count);<br/>then unchanged run → unchanged_runs + 1,<br/>else one source_runs row"]:::done
    V4["27 · inline runs: embed gate relevance ≥ 1/21<br/>(relevance@1.2.0, one of its 21 terms) → one<br/>embed job per new post (queued runs: the<br/>ingest worker applies the same gate)"]:::done
    V5["28 · scheduled run: leaveCycle(): counts added,<br/>inflight_runs − 1 (always, in finally); a one-shot<br/>job touches last_progress_at before and after<br/>every source, then completes or awaits<br/>its scoring retries → part 3"]:::done
    V1 --> V2 --> V3 --> V4 --> V5
  end

  subgraph LEGEND["Status legend"]
    L1["all done (every element is on master)"]:::done
  end

